          "text": "As I promised last week, a fresh list of Alpha Report readers' wins won't be long in coming. 🌭\n\nSo, let's take a closer look at the standout calls made by magnificent @HONKA_YO over the April.\n\nBut hang on tight, as this read may ignite an irresistible urge to join.\n\n👇        \n\n👾 Foreword\n\nIn this read, I'll share some of the most precious wins over April, and at the end of this month, I'll drop another read where I cover May cooks.\n\n🦧 Ok, so now let's move to wins.\n\nOn the 1st of April, @Fungi_ERC20i was mentioned in the Alpha Report at around 0.016$. ATH marked at 0.1$, so it was quite easy 6x.\n\nOn the same day, @testdontfollow_ appeared in the same edition. At that time, the project's token was around 0.00365$, while its ATH was around 0.014$. 4x bagged.\n\n@BaseStation_4 was mentioned on April 3rd at 0.0065$ and showed degens more than 3x.\n\n@epikduckcoin made it to Alpha Report at around 0.015$. Then it marked ATH at 0.06$ showing 4x gain.\n\nOn the 8th of April, @Michi_solana was mentioned at 0.016$. Shortly after, it skyrocketed to ATH at 0.6$ delivering soooo sweet 40x.\n\n@nomotaai was highlighted on 12.04, when it was sitting around 0.0048$, then it soared to ATH at 0.06$, 12x as a result.\n\nThen came @Bookof_Eth  on 26.04, when the token was around 0.009$ and after that marked ATH at 0.082$, resulting in 9x.\n\nLast but certainly not least - mention of @gomeonsol_  on the 29th of April at 0.003$. Result - ATH at 0.011$ and a cool 3x cook.\n\nAfter all these cooks, I'm sure that you're eager to get full access to our Alpha Reports, but how can you do that?\n\nWell, you have a couple of options:\n\n1. Join our Discord, fill out the form, be active, contribute to the family, and get a WL to become a Moni Wizard.\n2. Purchase the Pro or Alpha plan of Moni Discover.\n\n💜🧙‍♂️"
